    "description": "<p><strong>Range:</strong> Self</p><p>With a thought and a gesture, you pass through shadows and moonlight from one location to another.</p><p>When you use this ability, choose <strong>Astral </strong>or<strong> Umbral Step</strong>.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Astral Step</strong></p><ul><li><p>You teleport to a location bathed in moonlight up to your <strong>Stride</strong> speed away.</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul><li><p><strong>Umbral Step</strong></p><ul><li><p>You teleport a location cloaked in shadow up to your <strong>Stride</strong> speed away.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p>When you use this ability, you may choose to spend <strong>1 Resolve</strong> to move to a location up to twice your <strong>Stride</strong> speed away.</p>",
